OL,3,GNEWSATroubled estate 'just being left
OL,4,Ato die'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn estate which has been plagued by
OL,7,Fgang violence and anti-social behaviour
OL,8,Fis being left to "die", residents have
OL,9,Fclaimed.
OL,11,FWirral's Woodchurch Estate has problems
OL,12,Fwith litter, broken streetlights,
OL,13,Funeven footpaths, overflowing bins and
OL,14,Fdangerous broken fences, locals have
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FLenny Fowler said: "The place just
OL,18,Fseems to be dying."
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
