OL,3,GNEWSATroubled estate 'just being left
OL,4,Ato die'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe estate came to national prominence
OL,7,Fafter the murder of Elle Edwards, 26,
OL,8,Fwho was shot outside a pub on Christmas
OL,9,FEve 2022 by Connor Chapman, who opened
OL,10,Ffire with a sub-machine gun.
